title: I am donating my mind to science.
pid: d0193064-99c1-4667-8b12-9cd3409d38a6
body: |2-
  I build some of the public knowledge garden, a geometric game across states of mind. It shows me the way to oneness. I need your help.

  These are my public knowledge garden.

  https://github.com/JeffreyBenjaminBrown/public-notes-in-skg-format

  I also wrote some tech for sharing such things.
  You can keep private and public thoughts.
  You can fork others' thoughts, and merge them with yours.

  https://github.com/JeffreyBenjaminBrown/skg
